# 🚀 AI Career Connect

An AI-powered career advisor and interactive dashboard built using **Flask**, **SQLite**, **Mistral AI**, **Speech-to-Text (STT)**, and **Text-to-Speech (TTS)**.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

**AI Career Connect** is a intelligent web platform designed to assist job seekers, students, and professionals in planning their career paths. By leveraging state-of-the-art Large Language Models via the **Mistral AI API** alongside voice interactivity and real-time analytics, users can analyze skill gaps, practice interview responses, receive resume feedback, and visualize their career progression.

---

## ✨ Key Features

1. **🐍 Flask Modular Backend**: Built using the **Application Factory Pattern** and **Blueprints** for scalability and clean architecture.
2. **🗄️ SQLite & SQLAlchemy ORM**: Secure database handling user accounts, career profiles, skills, and chat histories.
3. **🤖 Mistral AI Integration**: Intelligent career recommendations, resume evaluation, and tailored learning path suggestions.
4. **🎤 Speech-to-Text (STT)**: Record voice prompts directly in the chat interface using browser audio streams transcribed via Google Web Speech API / SpeechRecognition.
5. **🔊 Text-to-Speech (TTS)**: Listen to AI career responses on demand with cloud (gTTS) and offline (pyttsx3) voice synthesis.
6. **📊 Dynamic Interactive Dashboard**: Dynamic stats and data visualization powered by **Plotly** to track skills, experience, and past AI advisory sessions.
7. **🎨 Modern Dark UI**: Sleek, responsive design built with CSS design tokens, smooth animations, and glassmorphism.

