## 🛠️ Technology Stack

- **Backend**: Python 3.10+, Flask 3.x, Flask-SQLAlchemy, Flask-Login, Flask-Migrate
- **Database**: SQLite3
- **AI Model**: Mistral AI (`mistral-large-latest`) via `mistralai` SDK
- **Speech Modules**: `SpeechRecognition` (STT), `gTTS` / `pyttsx3` (TTS)
- **Frontend**: Vanilla HTML5, CSS3 (CSS Variables, Flexbox/Grid), JavaScript (ES6+ Fetch API, MediaRecorder API)
- **Data Visualization**: Plotly.js

