## 🔌 API Endpoints Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth Required |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |
| `POST` | `/api/chat` | Send user prompt to Mistral AI & save history | Yes |
| `POST` | `/api/speech-to-text` | Upload audio recording and convert to text | Yes |
| `POST` | `/api/text-to-speech` | Convert response text into playable MP3 audio | Yes |

